stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ReplayReady
    ReplayReady --> CandidateInput: Domain B submits signed input
    CandidateInput --> Rejected: decode/admissibility failure
    CandidateInput --> ProjectedEvaluation: admissible input
    ProjectedEvaluation --> AbsorbingHalt: overflow or δ_window > ε
    ProjectedEvaluation --> Commit: bounded metrics and stable window
    Commit --> EncodeState: validator updates committed
    EncodeState --> RootComputed: canonical encoding + domain-tagged hash
    RootComputed --> ReplayReady: next epoch
    Rejected --> ReplayReady: no state mutation
    AbsorbingHalt --> EncodeState: halt reason encoded
    AbsorbingHalt --> AbsorbingHalt: halt is absorbing
